Standalone Live Runner orchestrator

Usage:
  livepeer-orchestrator [flags]
  livepeer-orchestrator [command]

Available Commands:
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  help        Help about any command
  migrate     Manage embedded SQL migrations
  redemptions Inspect recipient redemption state or explicitly retry stored transaction bytes

Flags:
  -c, --config string                      Configuration file; empty disables discovery (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_CONFIG) (default "config.toml")
  -n, --network string                     Network name (custom networks require explicit chain settings) (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_NETWORK) (default "offchain")
  -d, --data-dir string                    Component data directory; defaults to ~/.lpData/<network>/<component> (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_DATA_DIR) (default "$HOME/.lpData/offchain/orchestrator")
  -a, --account string                     Keystore account address (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_ACCOUNT)
  -o, --orchestrator-address string        Registered orchestrator address receiving ticket payments; defaults to the keystore account (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_ORCHESTRATOR_ADDRESS)
  -e, --eth-usd-feed string                ETH/USD oracle address, alternative to a fixed wei-per-usd rate (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_ETH_USD_FEED)
  -p, --price-max-age duration             Maximum age of the oracle observation (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_PRICE_MAX_AGE) (default 2h0m0s)
  -l, --listen string                      Public HTTP listener (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_LISTEN) (default "127.0.0.1:8935")
  -m, --metrics-listen string              Loopback metrics listener (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_METRICS_LISTEN) (default "127.0.0.1:8936")
  -s, --service-url string                 Public orchestrator base URL; defaults to http://listen (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_SERVICE_URL)
  -r, --runner-service-url string          Runner-facing base URL for callbacks and trickle; defaults to service-url (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_RUNNER_SERVICE_URL)
      --proxy-url-template string          Generated proxy URL with {proxy} in a hostname label or final path segment (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_PROXY_URL_TEMPLATE)
      --bootstrap-secret-file string       File containing runner bootstrap credential (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_BOOTSTRAP_SECRET_FILE)
      --runner-config string               Static runner TOML path (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_RUNNER_CONFIG)
      --redeemer-db string                  (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_REDEEMER_DB)
  -k, --keystore-file string               Encrypted geth redemption account JSON file (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_KEYSTORE_FILE)
      --keystore-password-file string      Owner-only file containing the exact keystore password bytes (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD_FILE)
      --rpc-url-file string                 (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_RPC_URL_FILE)
      --chain-id uint                       (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_CHAIN_ID)
      --redeemer-tx-timeout duration       Inclusion timeout for each redemption transaction attempt (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_REDEEMER_TX_TIMEOUT) (default 5m0s)
      --redeemer-max-tx-replacements int   Maximum fee replacements per redemption attempt (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_REDEEMER_MAX_TX_REPLACEMENTS) (default 1)
      --redeemer-max-fee-per-gas string    Optional maximum redemption fee in wei per gas (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_REDEEMER_MAX_FEE_PER_GAS)
      --controller-address string           (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_CONTROLLER_ADDRESS)
  -w, --wei-per-usd string                  (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_WEI_PER_USD)
  -t, --ticket-face-value string            (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_TICKET_FACE_VALUE)
      --ticket-win-prob string              (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_TICKET_WIN_PROB)
      --runner-grants strings              Private runner IP[:port] or CIDR grants (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_RUNNER_GRANTS)
      --session-proxy-grants strings       Private session proxy IP[:port] or CIDR grants (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_SESSION_PROXY_GRANTS)
      --health-grants strings              Private static runner health IP[:port] or CIDR grants (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_HEALTH_GRANTS)
      --heartbeat-interval duration        Runner heartbeat interval (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL) (default 5s)
      --heartbeat-ttl duration             Runner heartbeat expiry (env: LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_HEARTBEAT_TTL) (default 30s)
      --print-config                       Print audited redacted TOML configuration
  -h, --help                               help for livepeer-orchestrator
  -v, --version                            version for livepeer-orchestrator

Use "livepeer-orchestrator [command] --help" for more information about a command.

Environment Variables:
  LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_BOOTSTRAP_SECRET   Dynamic runner bootstrap credential
  LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD  Keystore decryption password
  LIVEPEER_ORCHESTRATOR_RPC_URL
